    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the water is actually making it feel stingy and awkward... my aunt always says butter helps seal it so it doesn't get air on it. if i just use a thin layer of something natural like tea tree oil or coconut oil, won't that be better than just leaving it wet? i really dont want to deal with an ER visit if it's just a minor thing.",
